<p>With your Neon Postgres database ready and your data exported from FaunaDB, the next step is to import this data into your newly created tables.</p>
<p>For this guide, we&#x27;ll demonstrate importing data from the <code>product.json</code> file (exported from FaunaDB) into the <code>products</code> table in Neon Postgres.</p>
